.container
  .row
    .col-xs-12
      #assessmentDashboard
        .contentTitleHeader
          i.glyphicon.glyphicon-log-in.titleIcon.pull-left
          p.contentTitle = t('.register')
        .col-xs-12
          .dashboardToggle
            .btn-group.dashboard role="group"
              = active_link_to t('.sign_in'), new_ecommerce_session_path, class: 'btn btn-default'
              = active_link_to t('.register'), new_ecommerce_registration_path, class: 'btn btn-default dashboardButton'
        = simple_form_for(resource, as: resource_name, url: ecommerce_registration_path) do |f|
          .col-xs-12
            == flash_messages
            = f.error_notification
            .col-md-6
              h3 Registration
              .form-group.col-lg-12
                = f.input :email, class: 'form-control'
              .row
                .form-group.col-lg-6
                  = f.input :password          
                .form-group.col-lg-6
                  = f.input :password_confirmation
              .row   
                .form-group.col-lg-6
                  = f.input :first_name   
                .form-group.col-lg-6
                  = f.input :last_name
            .col-md-6
              h3 Terms and Conditions
              p
                | By clicking on "Register" you agree to The Company's' Terms and Conditions
              p
                | Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nulla ornare eros ac sem laoreet dictum. Ut sit amet elementum felis, a pharetra nisi. Aenean imperdiet aliquam leo, sit amet cursus leo efficitur et. Curabitur fermentum elit dolor, condimentum fringilla ante pellentesque id.
              p
                | Quisque quis eros a risus pharetra vulputate posuere et lorem. Nam ac velit at metus efficitur euismod non a quam. Aenean vel rutrum ligula, ac volutpat eros. In dapibus venenatis erat ac fringilla. Aenean pellentesque ex a nulla suscipit volutpat.
              = f.input :terms, as: :boolean, label: 'By checking this box you agree to the terms &amp; conditions.', input_html: { class: 'checkbox' }
              button.btn.btn-primary.pull-right type="submit"  Register
        .clearfix  
